/T (For more than 40 years, Caister Festival has brought together local residents, visitors, businesses and community groups for one of the village's most anticipated annual events. As a free, family-friendly celebration, the festival attracts thousands of people across the weekend, providing a fantastic opportunity for businesses to raise their profile while supporting an event that sits at the heart of the local community.)
/E (For more than 40 years, Caister Festival has brought together local residents, visitors, businesses and community groups for one of the village's most anticipated annual events. As a free, family-friendly celebration, the festival attracts thousands of people across the weekend, providing a fantastic opportunity for businesses to raise their profile while supporting an event that sits at the heart of the local community.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
