/P 61 0 R
/T (By becoming a sponsor, your business will benefit from valuable exposure before, during and after the festival through event publicity, printed materials, social media and on-site branding. More importantly, you'll be demonstrating your commitment to the local community by helping ensure this much-loved event continues to thrive for future generations.)
